return ['project-id-version'=>'Lingua Forge 2.1.0','report-msgid-bugs-to'=>'https://wordpress.org/support/plugin/lingua-forge','last-translator'=>'admin','language-team'=>'Chinese (China)','mime-version'=>'1.0','content-type'=>'text/plain; charset=UTF-8','content-transfer-encoding'=>'8bit','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-06-01T15:14:22+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-06-01 20:23+0000','x-generator'=>'Loco https://localise.biz/','x-domain'=>'lingua-forge','language'=>'zh_CN','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','x-loco-version'=>'2.8.5; wp-7.0; php-8.3.31','messages'=>['Lingua Forge'=>'Lingua Forge','https://github.com/leotiger/lingua-forge'=>'https://github.com/leotiger/lingua-forge','Multilingual routing, SEO meta tags, and AI content tools for WordPress. Combines language detection, URL routing, hreflang, meta descriptions, and AI-powered excerpt, meta, and translation features.'=>'多语言路由、SEO元标签和AI内容工具，适用于WordPress。结合语言检测、URL路由、hreflang、元描述，以及由AI驱动的摘要、元信息和翻译功能。','Uli Hake'=>'Uli Hake','https://lingua-forge.com'=>'https://lingua-forge.com','Translate'=>'翻译','Lingua Forge — Quick Translate'=>'Lingua Forge — 快速翻译','Informative'=>'信息性','Persuasive'=>'说服性','Storytelling'=>'讲故事','Technical'=>'技术性','Conversational'=>'对话性','Permission denied.'=>'权限被拒绝。','Cannot determine target language from slug.'=>'无法从slug中确定目标语言。','Invalid post type.'=>'无效的帖子类型。','Invalid or primary language.'=>'无效或主要语言。','Template not found or not stored in the database.'=>'未找到模板或未存储在数据库中。','Template has no content.'=>'模板没有内容。','No internal links found to update.'=>'未找到要更新的内部链接。','%d link updated.'=>'%d 个链接已更新。' . "\0" . '','No language-specific template parts found to map.'=>'未找到要映射的特定语言模板部分。','No template part references needed updating.'=>'无需更新的模板部分引用。','%d part reference updated.'=>'%d 个模板部分引用已更新。' . "\0" . '','Invalid language.'=>'无效的语言。','Template part not found or not stored in the database.'=>'未找到模板部分或未存储在数据库中。','Template part has no content.'=>'模板部分没有内容。','No navigation references needed updating.'=>'无需更新的导航引用。','%d navigation reference updated.'=>'%d 个导航引用已更新。' . "\0" . '','No AI provider configured.'=>'未配置AI提供商。','Missing pattern name or language.'=>'缺少模式名称或语言。','Pattern not found.'=>'未找到模式。','Pattern has no content to translate.'=>'模式没有内容可翻译。','AI provider returned an empty response.'=>'AI提供商返回空响应。','Pattern translated and saved. Copy the content into your CPT post via the block editor Pattern inserter or use it as a starting point for a Reusable Block.'=>'模式已翻译并保存。通过块编辑器模式插入器将内容复制到您的CPT帖子中，或用作可重用块的起点。','Invalid template type.'=>'无效的模板类型。','Template "%s" already exists.'=>'模板“%s”已存在。','"%s" created.'=>'“%s”已创建。','Invalid template part.'=>'无效的模板部分。','Template part "%s" already exists.'=>'模板部分“%s”已存在。','"%1$s" created. %2$d template updated.'=>'“%1$s”已创建。%2$d 个模板已更新。' . "\0" . '','Page'=>'页面','Single'=>'单一','Search'=>'搜索','Search Results'=>'搜索结果','Archive'=>'存档','Front Page'=>'首页','Single: %s'=>'单一：%s','Single %s'=>'单一 %s','Archive: %s'=>'存档：%s','%s Archive'=>'%s 存档','No source content found to translate.'=>'未找到可翻译的源内容。','Translated. Review in the Site Editor — internal links, navigation URLs, and template slugs are not updated automatically.'=>'已翻译。在站点编辑器中查看——内部链接、导航URL和模板别名不会自动更新。','Navigation not found.'=>'未找到导航。','Navigation has no content to translate.'=>'导航没有内容可翻译。','"%1$s %2$s" saved.'=>'"%1$s %2$s" 已保存。','Translate page…'=>'翻译页面…','Generate content…'=>'生成内容…','AI Behaviour Preset'=>'AI行为预设','Custom'=>'自定义','Global default (%s)'=>'全局默认 (%s)','Overrides the AI preset for Translation and Content Generation on this page. Site-wide custom prompt instructions (Settings → Behavior) are always appended to every request regardless of this selection.'=>'覆盖此页面的AI预设，用于翻译和内容生成。站点范围的自定义提示指令（设置 → 行为）始终会附加到每个请求，无论此选择如何。','Overrides the AI preset for Translation and Content Generation on this page. All other features always use the global preset.'=>'覆盖此页面的AI预设，用于翻译和内容生成。所有其他功能始终使用全局预设。','Close'=>'关闭','Translate missing'=>'缺失翻译','From'=>'来自','Retranslate'=>'重新翻译','Translating…'=>'翻译中…','Retranslating…'=>'重新翻译中…','✓ Done'=>'✓ 完成','Error'=>'错误','Navigation posts are translated via the Router tab, not this button.'=>'导航文章通过路由标签进行翻译，而不是通过此按钮。','Creating translations for post type "%s" requires an active integration. Please ensure the required integration is installed and active.'=>'为"%s"类型的文章创建翻译需要激活的集成。请确保已安装并激活所需的集成。','No %s version found in this translation group.'=>'在此翻译组中未找到%s版本。','AI Usage'=>'AI使用情况','Today'=>'今天','Last 7 days'=>'过去7天','Last 30 days'=>'过去30天','All time'=>'全部时间','Token consumption rolled up by feature, provider, and model. Recorded on every successful AI call; Test Connection pings are deliberately excluded so they don\'t skew the totals. The underlying table aggregates daily — pick a window below to view it.'=>'按功能、提供者和模型统计的令牌消耗。每次成功的AI调用都会记录；测试连接的ping会被刻意排除，以免影响总数。底层表格按天汇总——请选择下面的时间窗口查看。','No AI usage recorded yet. Once an editor runs a translation, generates a meta description, or uses any other AI feature, totals will appear here.'=>'尚未记录AI使用情况。一旦编辑器执行翻译、生成元描述或使用任何其他AI功能，统计数据将显示在这里。','No AI usage recorded in the selected window (%s). Pick a wider range above.'=>'在所选时间窗口（%s）内未记录AI使用情况。请在上方选择更宽的时间范围。','Feature'=>'功能','Provider'=>'提供者','Model'=>'模型','Requests'=>'请求数','Input tokens'=>'输入令牌','Output tokens'=>'输出令牌','Total tokens'=>'总令牌','Total'=>'总计','API Keys'=>'API密钥','Keys are encrypted with AES-256-CBC before being stored in the WordPress database. The encryption secret is derived from your WordPress auth salts (wp-config.php), so plaintext keys never touch the database.'=>'密钥在存入WordPress数据库前会用AES-256-CBC加密。加密密钥来自您的WordPress认证盐（wp-config.php），因此明文密钥永远不会触及数据库。','API Key'=>'API密钥','Paste your API key…'=>'粘贴您的API密钥…','✓ Configured'=>'✓ 已配置','✗ Not configured'=>'✗ 未配置','Test connection'=>'测试连接','Leave blank to keep the existing key. Enter a new value to replace it.'=>'留空以保持现有密钥。输入新值以替换它。','Remove stored key'=>'移除存储的密钥','This key is currently supplied by a server %s and cannot be removed here. Enter a new key above to override it with a database value.'=>'此密钥目前由服务器%s提供，无法在此处移除。请在上方输入新密钥以用数据库中的值覆盖它。','environment variable'=>'环境变量','PHP constant'=>'PHP 常量','Alternative (server-side):'=>'备用（服务器端）：','You can also define keys as constants or environment variables (e.g. in wp-config.php). Those sources are used automatically as a fallback when no database key is stored.'=>'你也可以将键定义为常量或环境变量（例如在 wp-config.php 中）。当没有存储数据库键时，这些来源会自动用作后备方案。','To use a custom encryption secret (instead of the derived wp_salt value), add this to wp-config.php:'=>'要使用自定义加密密钥（而不是派生的 wp_salt 值），请将其添加到 wp-config.php：','Unknown provider.'=>'未知提供者。','No API key configured for this provider.'=>'此提供者未配置 API 密钥。','Could not instantiate the provider.'=>'无法实例化提供者。','Provider returned no text. Check the WordPress error log for the detailed failure reason.'=>'提供者未返回文本。请检查 WordPress 错误日志以获取详细的失败原因。','Behavior'=>'行为','Block Editor'=>'块编辑器','Lingua Forge restricts two Gutenberg features by default to keep editorial behavior consistent across languages. Opt in here when you need full Gutenberg / FSE capabilities.'=>'Lingua Forge 默认限制两个 Gutenberg 功能，以保持跨语言的编辑行为一致。当你需要完整的 Gutenberg / FSE 功能时，请在此选择加入。','Block locking'=>'块锁定','Allow editors to lock individual blocks'=>'允许编辑者锁定单个块','Re-enables Gutenberg\'s canLockBlocks. Useful for editorial templates that need to prevent contributors from moving or deleting specific blocks.'=>'重新启用 Gutenberg 的 canLockBlocks。适用于需要防止贡献者移动或删除特定块的编辑模板。','Template mode'=>'模板模式','Allow Gutenberg template-editing mode on post screens'=>'允许在文章屏幕上使用 Gutenberg 模板编辑模式','Re-enables supportsTemplateMode. Core to Full-Site-Editing workflows where post-level template overrides are intentional.'=>'重新启用 supportsTemplateMode。这是完整站点编辑工作流程的核心，适用于有意进行文章级模板覆盖的情况。','Compliance Preset'=>'合规预设','Strict-preservation mode for legal, regulatory, medical, or technical content. When on, every AI feature uses a low sampling temperature and appends the addendum below to its system prompt — terminology, article numbers, units, brand names, and regulatory language are preserved verbatim rather than paraphrased.'=>'用于法律、监管、医疗或技术内容的严格保存模式。开启后，每个 AI 功能都使用较低的采样温度，并在系统提示中附加以下补充内容——术语、文章编号、单位、品牌名称和监管语言将逐字保留，而非意译。','Global AI preset'=>'全局 AI 预设','T=%s'=>'T=%s','T=0.2–0.6, per feature'=>'每个功能的 T=0.2–0.6','Sets the default AI behaviour for all features site-wide. Individual posts can override this for Translation and Content Generation via the Lingua Forge meta box.'=>'设置整个站点所有功能的默认 AI 行为。单个文章可以通过 Lingua Forge 元框覆盖此设置，用于翻译和内容生成。','Standard uses each feature\'s own tuned temperature: Translation T=0.2 (precise), Quick Translate T=0.4, Content Generator T=0.6 (creative). The other presets apply a single fixed temperature across all features.'=>'标准使用每个功能的调优温度：翻译 T=0.2（精准），快速翻译 T=0.4，内容生成 T=0.6（创造性）。其他预设在所有功能中应用单一固定温度。','Technical / Scientific instructions'=>'技术/科学指令','Legal / Compliance instructions'=>'法律/合规指令','Creative / Marketing instructions'=>'创意/营销指令','Leave blank to use the built-in default. Clearing a saved override restores the default on next save.'=>'留空以使用内置默认值。清除已保存的覆盖将恢复默认值，下一次保存时生效。','View built-in default'=>'查看内置默认值','Translation Memory'=>'翻译记忆','Cache translated equivalents at the block level so reusable content (shared footers, sidebars, accordions, boilerplate-heavy legal sections) does not pay an API call every time. When enabled, the translation flow parses each post into blocks, looks each block up in the cache, and sends only uncached blocks to the AI in a single batched request. Glossary edits and Compliance preset changes automatically invalidate affected cached translations. View statistics and clear the cache under Maintenance.'=>'在块级缓存已翻译的等价内容，以避免每次调用 API（如共享页脚、侧边栏、手风琴、法律条款）都要支付一次调用费用。启用后，翻译流程会将每篇文章拆分为块，查找缓存中的内容，只将未缓存的块批量发送给 AI。词汇表编辑和合规预设更改会自动使受影响的缓存翻译失效。可在维护中查看统计信息和清除缓存。','Enable block-level translation cache reuse across posts'=>'启用跨文章块级翻译缓存重用','Currently skipped for posts that use block-comment attribute placeholders (wp:details summary fields, etc.) — they fall through to the existing single-call translation path.'=>'目前跳过使用块注释属性占位符（如 wp:details summary 字段等）的文章——它们会走现有的单次调用翻译路径。','General'=>'通用','Light'=>'轻量','Meta Description, Excerpt Generator'=>'元描述、摘要生成器','Quality'=>'质量','Translation, Content Generator'=>'翻译、内容生成','Active Provider'=>'当前提供者','Currently inherited from the %s constant. Selecting a value here will override it.'=>'目前继承自 %s 常量。这里选择的值将覆盖它。','Models'=>'模型','Features are grouped into two tiers. Enter the exact model identifier for each tier and provider. Leave a field blank to use the built-in default (shown as placeholder). Only the active provider\'s models are called at runtime — configure the others in advance if you plan to switch.'=>'功能分为两个层级。输入每个层级和提供者的确切模型标识符。留空使用内置默认（显示为占位符）。只有激活的提供者模型在运行时调用——如果计划切换，请提前配置其他模型。','active'=>'激活','overridden'=>'已覆盖','Tip: to reset a model to the built-in default, clear the field and save.'=>'提示：要将模型重置为内置默认值，清空字段并保存。','Glossary'=>'词汇表','User-managed terminology table per language pair. Entries are appended to the translation system prompt so the AI uses preferred terms consistently — critical for domain vocabulary ("kWp", "PPA", "interconnection point"), brand names that must not translate, and standardised regulatory phrasing. Both language fields are optional: leave "Source language" blank to apply the entry regardless of which language you are translating from; leave "Target language" blank to apply it to all target languages at once.'=>'每个语言对的用户管理术语表。条目会附加到翻译系统提示中，使 AI 始终使用偏好的术语——这对于领域词汇（“kWp”、“PPA”、“互联系点”）、不得翻译的品牌名和标准化的监管措辞至关重要。两个语言字段都是可选的：留空“源语言”以在任何翻译源语言时应用该条目；留空“目标语言”以同时应用于所有目标语言。','Glossary entry added.'=>'词汇表条目已添加。','Glossary entry removed.'=>'词汇表条目已删除。','Could not add entry: source term and target term are required.'=>'添加条目失败：需要源术语和目标术语。','Could not save the glossary entry.'=>'无法保存词汇表条目。','Source language'=>'源语言','— Any —'=>'— 任意 —','Target language'=>'目标语言','— Any target —'=>'— 任意目标 —','Filter'=>'筛选','Reset'=>'重置','No glossary entries match the current filter. Clear the filter to see all entries, or add a new entry below.'=>'没有符合当前筛选条件的词汇表条目。清除筛选以查看所有条目，或在下方添加新条目。','No glossary entries yet. Add one below to start enforcing terminology in translations.'=>'还没有词汇表条目。请在下方添加以开始在翻译中强制执行术语。','Source term'=>'源术语','Target term'=>'目标术语','Source lang'=>'源语言','Target lang'=>'目标语言','Notes'=>'备注','any'=>'任意','Delete this glossary entry?'=>'是否删除此词汇表条目？','Delete'=>'删除','Add new entry'=>'添加新条目','The phrase as it appears in the source text.'=>'在源文本中出现的短语。','How it should appear in the translation. Type the same value as the source term to instruct the AI to preserve it verbatim.'=>'在翻译中应如何显示。输入与源术语相同的值，以指示AI逐字保留。','— Any source language —'=>'— 任意源语言 —','Leave blank for brand names and language-agnostic terms that should be enforced regardless of which language we are translating from.'=>'对于品牌名称和应无论翻译自哪种语言都应强制保留的术语，留空即可。','— Any target language —'=>'— 任意目标语言 —','Leave blank to apply this entry to all target languages — ideal for brand names, abbreviations, and terms that must be preserved verbatim in every translation.'=>'留空以将此条目应用于所有目标语言——非常适合品牌名称、缩写和必须逐字保留的术语。','Optional context for editors (e.g. "ASIC = Application-Specific Integrated Circuit; preserve in English in technical contexts").'=>'编辑者的可选上下文（例如“ASIC = 应用特定集成电路；在技术上下文中保留英文”）。','Add entry'=>'添加条目','Limits'=>'限制','Authors and above (edit_published_posts)'=>'作者及以上（编辑已发布的文章）','Contributors and above — default (edit_posts)'=>'贡献者及以上——默认（编辑文章）','Editors and above (edit_others_posts)'=>'编辑者及以上（编辑他人文章）','Administrators only (manage_options)'=>'仅管理员（管理选项）','AI Limits & Security'=>'AI 限制与安全','Cap how much AI usage the site can generate and restrict which user roles may trigger paid AI calls. Sits on top of the per-user rate limit (30 requests / minute, hardcoded) that already protects against single-user runaway loops.'=>'限制网站生成的AI使用量，并限制哪些用户角色可以触发付费AI调用。位于每用户速率限制（每分钟30请求，硬编码）之上，已保护免受单一用户无限循环的影响。','Daily request limit'=>'每日请求限制','Site-wide ceiling on AI requests per UTC day (counts both Toolbar translations and block revisions). Counter resets at UTC midnight. Set to 0 to disable the cap.'=>'每个UTC日的全站AI请求上限（包括工具栏翻译和块修订）。计数器在UTC午夜重置。设置为0以禁用限制。','Minimum role'=>'最低角色','Lowest WordPress capability allowed to trigger AI features. Tightening this on multi-author sites prevents Contributors or trial accounts from running paid AI calls. Override per-feature via the linguaforge_required_capability filter.'=>'允许触发AI功能的最低WordPress权限。对多作者站点收紧此权限可以防止贡献者或试用账户运行付费AI调用。通过`linguaforge_required_capability`过滤器覆盖每个功能。','Translation Limits'=>'翻译限制','Control how much content is sent to the AI and how large the response can be. Leave a field blank to use the built-in default (shown as placeholder). Raise these values if large pages are being cut off; lower them to reduce API costs.'=>'控制向AI发送的内容量以及响应的最大大小。留空使用内置默认值（显示为占位符）。如果页面内容被截断，请提高这些值；如果想降低API成本，请降低它们。','Model tier'=>'模型层级','Quality (default — Sonnet / GPT-4o / Gemini Pro)'=>'质量（默认——Sonnet / GPT-4o / Gemini Pro）','Light (fast and cost-effective — Haiku / Flash)'=>'轻量（快速且成本效益高——Haiku / Flash）','Which model tier to use for full-page translation. Quality uses the model configured in the Models table above and is recommended for accurate, long-form translation. Switch to Light only if speed or cost is the priority and the content is short.'=>'用于全文翻译的模型层级。质量使用上表中配置的模型，适合准确的长篇翻译。仅当速度或成本优先且内容较短时切换到轻量。','Max output tokens'=>'最大输出标记数','Maximum number of tokens the AI may produce in a single translation response. If a translation is silently cut off at the end, increase this value. Default: 16 000.'=>'AI在单次翻译响应中可能生成的最大标记数。如果翻译在末尾被静默截断，请增加此值。默认：16000。','Max input characters'=>'最大输入字符数','Maximum number of characters of post content forwarded to the AI. 0 means no limit — the full content is always sent (recommended). Set a non-zero value only if your provider has a tight context window. A warning is written to the PHP error log whenever the content is trimmed.'=>'转发给AI的最大字符数。0表示无限制——始终发送完整内容（推荐）。仅在提供商有严格的上下文窗口时设置非零值。内容被截断时，PHP错误日志会有警告。','Quick Translation'=>'快速翻译','Quick Translation is used for snippet/chunk mode — short passages translated on demand from the toolbar, editor, or block popovers. It uses a separate, lighter configuration from the full-page translation to keep responses fast and cost-effective.'=>'快速翻译用于片段/块模式——从工具栏、编辑器或块弹出窗口按需翻译短段落。它使用与全文翻译不同的轻量配置，以保持响应速度快且成本低。','Light (default — fast and cost-effective)'=>'轻量（默认——快速且成本效益高）','Quality (Sonnet / GPT-4o / Gemini Pro)'=>'质量（十四行诗 / GPT-4o / Gemini Pro）','The Light tier uses the fast model configured in the Models table above (default: Haiku / Flash). Switch to Quality if you need the same translation accuracy as full-page mode for snippets.'=>'Light 级别使用上面模型表中配置的快速模型（默认：Haiku / Flash）。如果你需要与全页模式相同的翻译准确度，请切换到 Quality 级别。','Maximum tokens the AI may produce per quick translation. Default: 2 000.'=>'每次快速翻译，AI 可能生成的最大令牌数。默认：2000。','Maximum characters accepted from the input field. Default: 8 000.'=>'输入字段接受的最大字符数。默认：8000。','Content Generator'=>'内容生成器','Controls the token budget and input limits for the AI Content Generator feature. Leave fields blank to use the built-in defaults.'=>'控制 AI 内容生成器功能的令牌预算和输入限制。留空字段以使用内置默认值。','Maximum tokens the AI may produce per generation run. Raise this if full articles are being cut off. Default: 8 192.'=>'每次生成运行，AI 可能生成的最大令牌数。如果完整文章被截断，请增加此值。默认：8192。','Max hints characters'=>'最大提示字符数','Maximum characters read from the Hints field. Default: 2 000.'=>'从提示字段读取的最大字符数。默认：2000。','Max context characters'=>'最大上下文字符数','Maximum characters of existing post content passed to the AI as seed context when no Hints are provided. Default: 6 000.'=>'在未提供提示的情况下，传递给 AI 的现有帖子内容的最大字符数，作为种子上下文。默认：6000。','Maintenance'=>'维护','Language Overrides'=>'语言覆盖','Upload compiled .mo files to override third-party plugin strings for specific locales — for example, a custom VikBooking translation that uses "apartment" instead of "room". Files must follow the WordPress naming convention: {textdomain}-{locale}.mo (e.g. vikbooking-ca.mo). They are stored in the uploads folder and survive plugin updates.'=>'上传已编译的 .mo 文件以覆盖特定地区的第三方插件字符串——例如，使用“公寓”而非“房间”的自定义 VikBooking 翻译。文件必须遵循 WordPress 命名规范：{textdomain}-{locale}.mo（例如 vikbooking-ca.mo）。它们存储在上传文件夹中，并在插件更新时保持不变。','Override file uploaded successfully.'=>'覆盖文件上传成功。','Override file deleted.'=>'覆盖文件已删除。','No file was selected.'=>'未选择文件。','Only .mo files are accepted.'=>'只接受 .mo 文件。','The upload failed — please try again.'=>'上传失败——请重试。','Could not save the file. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'无法保存文件。请检查上传文件夹是否可写。','Invalid filename.'=>'文件名无效。','Security check failed — file path is not permitted.'=>'安全检查失败——文件路径不允许。','An unknown error occurred.'=>'发生未知错误。','Text domain / locale'=>'文本域 / 语言环境','Files'=>'文件','Size'=>'大小','Delete all files for this override (both .mo and .po)?'=>'是否删除此覆盖的所有文件（包括 .mo 和 .po）？','No override files uploaded yet.'=>'尚未上传任何覆盖文件。','Upload .mo file'=>'上传 .mo 文件','Accepts compiled .mo files only. Filename must follow the pattern {textdomain}-{locale}.mo. Uploading a file with the same name as an existing one will replace it.'=>'只接受已编译的 .mo 文件。文件名必须遵循 {textdomain}-{locale}.mo 的模式。上传同名文件将覆盖现有文件。','Upload Override'=>'上传覆盖','Loco Translate — Copy to Safe Storage'=>'Loco Translate — 复制到安全存储','Loco Translate stores its custom translations in wp-content/languages/loco/ — a location that can be silently wiped by a WP core update, plugin reinstall, or if Loco Translate itself is removed. Copying files here moves them into the Lingua Forge i18n-overrides directory, which persists through all of those events and is loaded automatically on every request.'=>'Loco Translate 将其自定义翻译存储在 wp-content/languages/loco/ 目录中——该位置可能在 WordPress 核心更新、插件重装或删除 Loco Translate 时被静默清除。将文件复制到此处会将它们移动到 Lingua Forge i18n-overrides 目录，该目录在所有这些事件中都能持续存在，并在每次请求时自动加载。','File copied to safe storage successfully.'=>'文件成功复制到安全存储。','Source file not found.'=>'未找到源文件。','Could not copy the file. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'无法复制文件。请检查上传文件夹是否可写。','Invalid file reference.'=>'文件引用无效。','Type'=>'类型','✓ In safe storage'=>'✓ 在安全存储中','Copy to safe storage'=>'复制到安全存储','No custom Loco Translate files found yet. They appear here once you save a translation in Loco Translate.'=>'尚未找到自定义 Loco Translate 文件。保存翻译后，它们会显示在这里。','AI Cache'=>'AI 缓存','Lingua Forge caches AI-generated translations, meta descriptions, excerpts, and generated content per-post so unchanged inputs do not re-trigger a paid API call. Cached entries are automatically invalidated when their inputs change. Clear the cache manually to reclaim database space, force a resync after switching providers or editing prompt templates, or troubleshoot a cache-related issue.'=>'Lingua Forge 缓存 AI 生成的翻译、元描述、摘要和每帖生成的内容，以避免未更改的输入重新触发付费 API 调用。缓存条目在输入更改时会自动失效。手动清除缓存可以回收数据库空间，在切换提供商或编辑提示模板后强制重新同步，或排查缓存相关问题。','AI cache cleared. %d entry was removed.'=>'AI 缓存已清除。%d 条目已移除。' . "\0" . '','Clear all cached AI results? Future requests will trigger fresh API calls until the cache rebuilds.'=>'清除所有缓存的 AI 结果？未来请求将触发新的 API 调用，直到缓存重建。','Clear AI Cache'=>'清除 AI 缓存','Debug Files'=>'调试文件','When debug logging is enabled (via the toggle below or by defining LINGUAFORGE_AI_DEBUG in wp-config.php), the Translation and FSE template translation features write their raw AI prompts and responses to disk for troubleshooting. Use this section to monitor that output and clear it once you have what you need — the files can grow quickly on large pages. Configure the destination directory via the linguaforge_debug_dir filter.'=>'启用调试日志（通过下面的切换或在 wp-config.php 中定义 LINGUAFORGE_AI_DEBUG），翻译和 FSE 模板翻译功能会将其原始 AI 提示和响应写入磁盘以进行故障排除。使用此部分监控输出，完成后清除——文件在大页面上可能快速增长。通过 linguaforge_debug_dir 过滤器配置目标目录。','Debug files cleared. %d file was removed.'=>'调试文件已清除。%d 个文件已删除。' . "\0" . '','Debug logging enabled.'=>'调试日志已启用。','Debug logging disabled.'=>'调试日志已禁用。','Debug logging'=>'调试日志','Write AI prompts and responses to disk for troubleshooting'=>'将AI提示和响应写入磁盘以进行故障排除','Forced ON by the LINGUAFORGE_AI_DEBUG constant in wp-config.php. Remove that line to control this toggle from here.'=>'由wp-config.php中的LINGUAFORGE_AI_DEBUG常量强制开启。删除该行即可从这里控制此切换。','Forced OFF by the LINGUAFORGE_AI_DEBUG constant in wp-config.php. Remove that line to control this toggle from here.'=>'由wp-config.php中的LINGUAFORGE_AI_DEBUG常量强制关闭。删除该行即可从这里控制此切换。','Files land in the directory below. Useful for diagnosing translation issues — turn off once you have what you need so the files do not accumulate. You can also force this from wp-config.php with `define( \'LINGUAFORGE_AI_DEBUG\', true );` which overrides the toggle.'=>'文件存放在以下目录中。用于诊断翻译问题——在你获得所需内容后关闭，以免文件堆积。你也可以在wp-config.php中使用`define( \'LINGUAFORGE_AI_DEBUG\', true );`强制开启，此设置会覆盖切换。','Currently:'=>'当前：','✓ Enabled'=>'✓ 已启用','✗ Disabled'=>'✗ 已禁用','Directory'=>'目录','Filter with linguaforge_debug_dir to redirect debug output to a non-public location.'=>'使用linguaforge_debug_dir过滤，将调试输出重定向到非公共位置。','.txt file(s) in the directory'=>'.txt文件在目录中','Save Debug Setting'=>'保存调试设置','Delete all .txt files in the debug directory? The directory itself will remain so future debug writes still land cleanly.'=>'是否删除调试目录中的所有.txt文件？目录本身将保持不变，以便未来的调试写入仍然可以正常存放。你也可以在wp-config.php中使用`define( \'LINGUAFORGE_AI_DEBUG\', true );`强制开启，此设置会覆盖切换。','Clear Debug Files'=>'清除调试文件','Per-block translation cache shared across posts. Configure on/off in Settings → Behavior. Stats below show what is currently cached; clearing forces every block to be re-translated on next request (useful after upgrading models or to recover database space).'=>'跨帖子共享的每块翻译缓存。在设置→行为中配置开关。下面的统计显示当前缓存的内容；清除后，下一次请求时每块都将重新翻译（升级模型后或为了回收数据库空间非常有用）。','Translation Memory cleared. %d cached block was removed.'=>'翻译记忆已清除。%d个缓存块已被移除。' . "\0" . '','Status'=>'状态','— toggle in Settings → Behavior.'=>'— 在设置→行为中切换。','Cached blocks'=>'缓存块','Cumulative cache hits'=>'累计缓存命中','(avg %.1f hits/block)'=>'（平均 %.1f 次/块）','Oldest entry'=>'最旧的条目','Newest entry'=>'最新的条目','Approximate size'=>'大致大小','Clear the entire Translation Memory? Future translations will rebuild the cache as they run.'=>'清除整个翻译记忆？未来的翻译将重新构建缓存。','Clear Translation Memory'=>'清除翻译记忆','Uninstall Behaviour'=>'卸载行为','Controls what happens when an administrator deletes the plugin from Plugins → Installed Plugins → Delete. Plugin settings and AI caches are always removed. Language assignments and translation relationships are kept by default so an accidental uninstall or a reinstall can pick up where it left off.'=>'控制管理员从插件→已安装插件→删除中删除插件时的行为。插件设置和AI缓存总是会被删除。默认会保留语言分配和翻译关系，以便意外卸载或重新安装时可以继续之前的状态。','Uninstall setting saved.'=>'卸载设置已保存。','Delete content data on uninstall'=>'卸载时删除内容数据','Also delete language assignments, translation relationships, meta descriptions, glossary, and Translation Memory when the plugin is uninstalled'=>'卸载插件时也删除语言分配、翻译关系、元描述、词汇表和翻译记忆','Warning:'=>'警告：','If checked, uninstalling the plugin will permanently delete all language assignments, translation relationships, meta descriptions, per-page presets, the AI glossary, and Translation Memory for every post on this site. This cannot be undone. Leave unchecked unless you are fully removing multilingual support from the site.'=>'如果勾选，卸载插件将永久删除所有语言分配、翻译关系、元描述、每页预设、AI词汇表和每个帖子的翻译记忆。这无法撤销。除非你完全移除网站的多语言支持，否则请不要勾选。','Save Uninstall Setting'=>'保存卸载设置','Router'=>'路由器','Primary language saved.'=>'主要语言已保存。','Permalink rules flushed successfully.'=>'永久链接规则已成功刷新。','Primary Language'=>'主要语言','The primary language is always served at the root of your site — no URL prefix in path mode, no language subdomain in subdomain mode. All other languages use either a /lang/ path prefix (e.g. example.com/de/) or a language subdomain (e.g. de.example.com), depending on the URL structure setting below.'=>'主要语言始终在你网站的根目录提供——在路径模式下没有URL前缀，在子域名模式下没有语言子域名。其他所有语言使用/语言/路径前缀（例如example.com/de/）或语言子域名（例如de.example.com），具体取决于下面的URL结构设置。','Primary language'=>'主要语言','After changing the primary language, flush permalinks (section below) for the URL routing to update.'=>'更改主要语言后，刷新永久链接（下节）以更新URL路由。','URL structure'=>'URL结构','Path prefix — example.com/de/'=>'路径前缀——example.com/de/','Subdomain — de.example.com/'=>'子域名——de.example.com/','Subdomain mode requires your web server to point all language subdomains (e.g. de.example.com) to this WordPress installation. After switching modes, flush permalink rules and clear any caches. If your home URL includes www (e.g. www.example.com), use the lf_base_domain filter to set the bare apex domain so subdomains are constructed correctly.'=>'子域名模式要求你的Web服务器将所有语言子域名（例如de.example.com）指向此WordPress安装。切换模式后，刷新永久链接规则并清除任何缓存。如果你的主页URL包含www（例如www.example.com），请使用lf_base_domain过滤器设置裸露的顶级域名，以确保子域名正确构建。','Browser language redirect'=>'浏览器语言重定向','Redirect visitors to their preferred language based on the browser\'s Accept-Language header'=>'根据浏览器的Accept-Language头，将访客重定向到其偏好的语言版本','When enabled, first-time visitors with no language cookie and no language prefix in the URL are redirected to the closest matching language version. The redirect is skipped if the browser\'s preferred language is not among the active router languages. Once a visitor selects a language via the switcher, the cookie takes priority and the browser header is ignored on all future visits.'=>'启用后，没有语言Cookie且URL中没有语言前缀的首次访问者将被重定向到最接近的匹配语言版本。如果浏览器首选语言不在激活的路由器语言中，则跳过重定向。一旦访客通过切换器选择了语言，Cookie将优先，未来的访问将忽略浏览器头信息。','Save Router Settings'=>'保存路由器设置','Flush Permalinks'=>'刷新固定链接','Regenerates WordPress rewrite rules so URL prefixes, language-specific slugs, and archive rewrites are all in sync. Necessary after changing the primary language or adding new language support.'=>'重新生成WordPress重写规则，以确保URL前缀、特定语言的别名和存档重写保持同步。更改主要语言或添加新语言支持后需要执行此操作。','Flush Permalink Rules'=>'刷新永久链接规则','Active Languages'=>'活动语言','Languages currently known to the router (derived from installed WordPress locale packs plus the primary language). Install additional language packs in the section below to make more languages available for routing and translation.'=>'路由器当前已知的语言（由已安装的WordPress区域包和主要语言派生）。在下面的部分安装额外的语言包，以使更多语言可用于路由和翻译。','%d locale pack installed.'=>'已安装%d个区域包。' . "\0" . '','Install a Language'=>'安装语言','Download and install a WordPress core language pack directly from WordPress.org. Once installed, the locale becomes available for URL routing and the AI translation workflow. The list of available languages is fetched on demand — click the button below to load it.'=>'直接从WordPress.org下载并安装WordPress核心语言包。安装后，区域成为URL路由和AI翻译工作流程的可用选项。可用语言列表按需获取——点击下面的按钮加载。','Language installation is disabled on this server. The DISALLOW_FILE_MODS constant is set in wp-config.php. Install language packs manually via WP-CLI: wp language core install de_DE'=>'此服务器禁用语言安装。wp-config.php中设置了DISALLOW_FILE_MODS常量。通过WP-CLI手动安装语言包：wp language core install de_DE','Load available languages'=>'加载可用语言','— select a language —'=>'— 选择一种语言 —','Install'=>'安装','Language Setup'=>'语言设置','No secondary languages configured. Install a language pack above to enable template scaffolding.'=>'未配置次要语言。请在上方安装语言包以启用模板脚手架。','Select a language to manage its FSE templates, template parts, and navigation menus.'=>'选择一种语言以管理其FSE模板、模板部分和导航菜单。','Forbidden'=>'禁止访问','Language installation is disabled on this server (DISALLOW_FILE_MODS is set).'=>'此服务器禁用语言安装（设置了DISALLOW_FILE_MODS）。','Invalid locale code.'=>'无效的区域代码。','Language %s installed successfully.'=>'语言%s已成功安装。','Language pack installation failed. The language may already be installed, the locale code may be incorrect, or your server may block file writes.'=>'语言包安装失败。可能是已安装该语言、区域代码错误，或服务器阻止文件写入。','Navigations'=>'导航','Navigation translation requires an active AI provider. Configure an API key in the API Keys tab.'=>'导航翻译需要激活的AI提供商。在API密钥标签中配置API密钥。','Navigation'=>'导航','Action'=>'操作','Re-translate'=>'重新翻译','CPT Block Patterns'=>'CPT块模式','Block patterns registered for custom post types. Use the Translate button to produce a language variant. The translated content is saved here and can be copied into any CPT post from the block editor Pattern inserter or used as a starting point for a Synced Pattern (Reusable Block).'=>'为自定义文章类型注册的块模式。使用“翻译”按钮生成语言变体。翻译内容保存在此处，可从块编辑器的模式插入器复制到任何CPT文章中，或用作同步模式（可重用块）的起点。','Pattern'=>'模式','Post Types'=>'文章类型','✓ Translation saved'=>'✓ 翻译已保存','View'=>'查看','Template Parts'=>'模板部分','Language-specific copies of the theme\'s template parts. Once scaffolded, templates are updated to reference the language-specific part.'=>'主题模板部分的特定语言副本。脚手架完成后，模板会更新以引用特定语言的部分。','Part'=>'部分','Status / Actions'=>'状态 / 操作','Fix Links'=>'修复链接','Fix Nav'=>'修复导航','Create'=>'创建','Templates'=>'模板','FSE templates seeded from the active theme. Create then customise in the Site Editor.'=>'从激活的主题播种的FSE模板。在站点编辑器中创建并自定义。','Actions'=>'操作','Fix Parts'=>'修复部分','Create missing'=>'创建缺失部分','Translate all'=>'全部翻译','Fix all parts'=>'修复所有部分','Fix all links'=>'修复所有链接','Anthropic (Claude)'=>'Anthropic（Claude）','OpenAI (GPT)'=>'OpenAI（GPT）','Google (Gemini)'=>'Google（Gemini）','Testing…'=>'测试中…','✓ Connection OK'=>'✓ 连接正常','✗ Failed:'=>'✗ 失败：','No response from provider — check the error log for details.'=>'没有收到提供者的响应 — 请检查错误日志以获取详细信息。','Network error — could not reach the WordPress AJAX endpoint.'=>'网络错误 — 无法连接到 WordPress AJAX 端点。','Loading…'=>'加载中…','Installing…'=>'安装中…','✓ Language installed.'=>'✓ 语言已安装。','✗ Error:'=>'✗ 错误：','Creating…'=>'创建中…','✓ All templates created.'=>'✓ 所有模板已创建。','Some templates could not be created.'=>'部分模板无法创建。','✓ All parts created.'=>'✓ 所有部分已创建。','Some parts could not be created.'=>'部分部分无法创建。','✓ All translated.'=>'✓ 所有已翻译。','Some translations failed.'=>'部分翻译失败。','Review carefully — links and slugs not updated.'=>'请仔细检查 — 链接和别名未更新。','Fixing…'=>'修复中…','✓ Links fixed.'=>'✓ 链接已修复。','Some link fixes failed.'=>'部分链接修复失败。','✓ Parts fixed.'=>'✓ 部分已修复。','Some part fixes failed.'=>'部分修复失败。','✓ Nav refs fixed.'=>'✓ 导航引用已修复。','Some nav ref fixes failed.'=>'部分导航引用修复失败。','✓ Pattern translated.'=>'✓ 模式已翻译。','Pattern translation failed.'=>'模式翻译失败。','Hide'=>'隐藏','Built-in preset instructions:'=>'内置预设指令：','No built-in instructions — each AI feature uses its o